pageType: final
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
notes: End with energy. The wall is the deliverable — the photo and hotspot owners make it stick.
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 100, 400, 22]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      text: BEFORE WE START
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 128, 800, 50]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      fontSize: 34
      text: By the end, the wall is the deliverable
  - elementId: list
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 210, 560, 160]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 16
      lineHeight: 1.7
      text: |
        <p><strong>A photographed timeline</strong> of how our business actually works</p>
        <p><strong>Named boundaries</strong> between the parts of the process</p>
        <p><strong>Hotspots with owners</strong> — every question has someone chasing it</p>
        <p><strong>One agreed next step</strong>: refine, write stories, or design</p>
  - elementId: note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 430, 800, 60]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      fontSize: 13
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: |
        <p>Everything on the wall stays a draft. The value is the conversation we are about to have.</p>
        <p><strong>Grab a marker — let's begin.</strong></p>
  - elementId: sq1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [720, 200, 76, 76]
    shapeName: rect
    rotation: -3
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$event"}
  - elementId: sq2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [812, 236, 76, 76]
    shapeName: rect
    rotation: 2
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$command"}
  - elementId: sq3
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [744, 304, 76, 76]
    shapeName: rect
    rotation: -1.5
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$policy"}
  - elementId: pagenum
    elementType: text
    bounds: [900, 505, 40, 20]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [right, middle]
      text: "7"
